{"id":"entschuldigung","lemma":"Entschuldigung","pos":"noun","rank":375,"glosses":["apology (expression of remorse or regret)","excuse (explanation designed to avoid or alleviate guilt or negative judgment)","note (written excusal for being late or absent from school)"],"ipa":"/ɛntˈʃʊldiɡʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/51/De-Entschuldigung.ogg/De-Entschuldigung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Entschuldigung","plural":"Entschuldigungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich habe keine Entschuldigung.","en":"I have no excuse.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/28543","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Entschuldigung, aber können Sie mir helfen?","en":"Excuse me, but can you help me?","words":[null,{"g":"but"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Er hat meine Entschuldigungen nicht angenommen.","en":"He did not accept my apologies.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to assume, to suppose","l":"annehmen"}]},{"text":"Ich nehme deine Entschuldigung an.","en":"I accept your apology.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756297","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to take","l":"nehmen"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"Ich möchte deine Entschuldigungen nicht hören.","en":"I don't want to hear your excuses.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)"}]}]}